# Each run's raw stream and session transcript are large (about 80 MB for
# the runs so far). The summaries (<time>.jsonl, <time>.md) and each run's
# diff are kept.
results/**/20[0-9][0-9][01][0-9][0-3][0-9]-*/*.jsonl
# The published evaluation (-eval -out eval-..., docs/eval.md) keeps them,
# scrubbed: its transcripts are part of what it publishes.
!results/eval-*/20[0-9][0-9][01][0-9][0-3][0-9]-*/*.jsonl
